{"id":"presente","lemma":"presente","pos":"noun","rank":1111,"glosses":["present, present tense","present (the current moment)","gift, handout"],"ipa":"/pɾeˈsente/","gender":"m","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-presente.wav","examples":[{"text":"No había nadie presente.","en":"No one was present.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/524922"},{"text":"Deja que te lo presente.","en":"Let me introduce you to him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/641878"},{"text":"Dile a Tom que se presente.","en":"Tell Tom to show up.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799952"},{"text":"¿Estabas presente cuando ocurrió el accidente?","en":"Were you there when the accident happened?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/832930"},{"text":"Deja que te presente a mi familia.","en":"Let me introduce you to my family.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/462100"}]}